      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "You have \"Maximum Uncompressed Size\" set to \"0 MB\", that will correctly block all avatars and show impostors and fallback avatars everywhere.\n\nDiscord thread for context: https://discord.com/channels/189511567539306508/1414227082007019602\n\nMaybe the setting should be changed to say \"Block All\" instead of \"0 MB\", since that would cause less confusion.",
